---
description: Integration branch and pull-request target for this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

Treat `develop` as the default base branch for this repository.

- Create feature branches from the latest `origin/develop`. Fetch first if your local copy may be stale.
- Open GitHub pull requests against `develop` (ManagePullRequest / GitHub UI `base=develop`).
- Do not target `main` unless the user explicitly asks for `main` (for example a release).
- Do not merge to `main` as part of ordinary feature work.
- Do not deploy GitHub Pages from `develop`; that branch is in-house.
